{"name":"Mulptan","status":"ok","title":"Mulptan","pageId":114753,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-frwiki pi-layout-default type-location\">\n\n\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Mulptan</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Geography<sup id=\"cite_ref-S.CG-p83_1-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-S.CG-p83-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite_ref-UE-p145_2-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-UE-p145-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"type\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Type</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Settlement</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"region\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Region</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Rashemen\" title=\"Rashemen\">Rashemen</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Unapproachable_East\" title=\"Unapproachable East\">Unapproachable East</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"size\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Size</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Large city</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Society<sup id=\"cite_ref-S.CG-p83_1-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-S.CG-p83-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite_ref-DD-p61_3-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-DD-p61-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"races\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Races</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><table class=\"percentagetable\"><tbody><tr><td> <a href=\"/wiki/Human\" title=\"Human\">Humans</a>  </td><td> 71%  </td></tr><tr><td> <a href=\"/wiki/Dwarves\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Dwarves\">Dwarves</a>  </td><td> 29%  </td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Politics<sup id=\"cite_ref-UE-p145_2-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-UE-p145-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"ruler\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Ruler</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Multrong (Eastlord)</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">History<sup id=\"cite_ref-DD-p61_3-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-DD-p61-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"population1\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Population</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">6,900&#160;in <a href=\"/wiki/1358_DR\" title=\"1358 DR\">1358&#160;DR</a><br>39,390<sup id=\"cite_ref-FRCS3e-p205_4-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCS3e-p205-4\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>4<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>&#160;in <a href=\"/wiki/1372_DR\" title=\"1372 DR\">1372&#160;DR</a></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Locations_in_Mulptan\" title=\"Category:Locations in Mulptan\">Locations in  Mulptan</a></nav>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Organizations_in_Mulptan\" title=\"Category:Organizations in Mulptan\">Organizations in  Mulptan</a></nav>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><b>Mulptan</b> was the great trade city of <a href=\"/wiki/Rashemen\" title=\"Rashemen\">Rashemen</a>. It was one of the nation's more cosmopolitan locales and was considered the \"Gateway\" to the lands of <a href=\"/wiki/Northeast_Faer%C3%BBn\" title=\"Northeast Faerûn\">the north</a>.<sup id=\"cite_ref-S.CG-p83_1-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-S.CG-p83-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite_ref-UE-p145_2-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-UE-p145-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite_ref-FRCS3e-p205_4-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCS3e-p205-4\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>4<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\"><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Description\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Description</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Geography\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Geography</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Trade\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Trade</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#History\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">History</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Notable_Locations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Notable Locations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Inhabitants\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Inhabitants</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Appendix\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Appendix</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#References\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">References</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Description\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Mulptan?veaction=edit&section=1\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Description\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The vast, wind-battered city was encircled by a great stone wall, outside of which was its great trading field. The tents and and stalls found in mercantile marketplace were crowded with people of many different ethnicities and foreign nations.<sup id=\"cite_ref-S.CG-p83_1-3\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-S.CG-p83-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite_ref-UE-p145_2-3\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-UE-p145-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Geography\">Geography</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Geography\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Mulptan?veaction=edit&section=2\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Geography\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Mulptan lay on the intersection of the <a href=\"/wiki/Huhrong%27s_Road\" title=\"Huhrong's Road\">Huhrong's Road</a> and a long road that ran north-south through Rashemen.<sup id=\"cite_ref-UE-p129_5-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-UE-p129-5\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>5<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> It was located 80 mi  (130 km) east of <a href=\"/wiki/Immilmar\" title=\"Immilmar\">Immilmar</a>, about five days south of the <a href=\"/wiki/Falls_of_Erech\" title=\"Falls of Erech\">Falls of Erech</a>, and three days east of the <a href=\"/wiki/Ring_of_Blue_Fire\" title=\"Ring of Blue Fire\">Ring of Blue Fire</a>, as traveled by horseback.<sup id=\"cite_ref-S.CG-p83_1-4\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-S.CG-p83-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite_ref-UE-p145_2-4\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-UE-p145-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trade\">Trade</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Trade\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Mulptan?veaction=edit&section=3\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Trade\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Mulptan's great trading fields drew foreign merchants and businesspeople from many nearby nations, including <a href=\"/wiki/Damara\" title=\"Damara\">Damara</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Impiltur\" title=\"Impiltur\">Impiltur</a>.<sup id=\"cite_ref-FRCS3e-p205_4-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCS3e-p205-4\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>4<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> In contrast to other cities in Rashemen, it allowed outlander traders to take up residence within the city,<sup id=\"cite_ref-S.CG-p83_1-5\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-S.CG-p83-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> pending approval of the <a href=\"/wiki/Wychlaran\" title=\"Wychlaran\">Wychlaran</a>.<sup id=\"cite_ref-S.CG-p85_6-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-S.CG-p85-6\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>6<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p><p>Many traders came to Mulptan from  the <a href=\"/wiki/Long_Road_(Northeast_Faer%C3%BBn)\" title=\"Long Road (Northeast Faerûn)\">Long Road</a>, a route that crossed the <a href=\"/wiki/Endless_Wastes\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Endless Wastes\">Endless Wastes</a> from the <a href=\"/wiki/Cold_Lands\" title=\"Cold Lands\">Cold Lands</a> and connected to Huhrong's Road.<sup id=\"cite_ref-UE-p145_2-5\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-UE-p145-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite_ref-S.CG-p73_7-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-S.CG-p73-7\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>7<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"History\">History</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: History\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Mulptan?veaction=edit&section=4\" aria-label=\"Edit section: History\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The infrastructure of Mulptan predated the city itself, dating back to the ancient conflicts between <a href=\"/wiki/Narfell\" title=\"Narfell\">Narfell</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Raumathar\" title=\"Raumathar\">Raumathar</a>.<sup id=\"cite_ref-UE-p145_2-6\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-UE-p145-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notable_Locations\">Notable Locations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Notable Locations\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Mulptan?veaction=edit&section=5\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Notable Locations\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Western Quarter, a region of Mulptan inhabited predominantly by folk from Damara or <a href=\"/wiki/Thesk\" title=\"Thesk\">Thesk</a>. Ironically it was located on the northeastern side of the city.<sup id=\"cite_ref-UE-p145_2-7\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-UE-p145-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></li>\n<li>Shou Quarter, the southern district of the city that presumably housed many <a href=\"/wiki/Shou\" title=\"Shou\">Shou</a> people.<sup id=\"cite_ref-UE-p145_2-8\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-UE-p145-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Inhabitants\">Inhabitants</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Inhabitants\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Mulptan?veaction=edit&section=6\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Inhabitants\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Mulptan was home to the <span class=\"new\" title=\"Ydrass (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvWWRyYXNzP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">Ydrass</span> and <span class=\"new\" title=\"Vrul (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvVnJ1bD9hY3Rpb249ZWRpdCZyZWRsaW5rPTE=\">Vrul</span> Rashemaar clans, each of whom enjoyed an old and sometimes bloody rivalry with the other.<sup id=\"cite_ref-S.CG-p83_1-6\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-S.CG-p83-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> Each family had hundreds of members and held great sway over the economic interests of the city, often sponsoring great contests of athleticism for which Rashemen was famous.<sup id=\"cite_ref-UE-p145_2-9\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-UE-p145-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite_ref-FRCS3e-p205_4-3\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCS3e-p205-4\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>4<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Appendix\">Appendix</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Appendix\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Mulptan?veaction=edit&section=7\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Appendix\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" i